        <mxCell id="scope" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Boxes inside a database are tables.&lt;br&gt;The log is a separate file.&lt;br&gt;Selected fields only; full notes are in the storage guide." vertex="1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontColor=#172b4d;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9caec2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;">
